---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CLARITY_ID, CONTACT_EMAIL, GA4_ID, LAST_UPDATED, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Legal Notice: Publisher and Host of the Solar Calculator" description="Legal notice: who publishes, answers for and hosts the solar calculator for every Italian comune; purpose of the site, liability, embedding and personal data." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <p>Information about the publisher of {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <h2>Responsible for content</h2>
    <p>{AUTHOR_NAME}, address as above, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>Purpose of the site</h2>
    <p>The site estimates the output and return of a home solar system with PVGIS radiation data (European Commission), the hourly household withdrawals metered by ARERA, the ritiro dedicato prices published by the GSE and the tax deduction set out by the Agenzia delle Entrate. It is not an offer from an installer, energy supplier, the GSE or a public authority, and not tax, technical or legal advice. Calculation steps are under <a href={route('method', lang)}>How we calculate</a>.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>Values are checked automatically before every release and reconciled whenever a source changes; we give no guarantee for the yield of a specific system. Linked third-party sites are the responsibility of their operators. Please report errors via the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Embedding</h2>
    <p>The calculator may be embedded free of charge by iframe as long as the source link stays visible: <a href={route('widget', lang)}>Embed the calculator</a>.</p>
    {/* gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Personal data and cookies</h2>
    {GA4_ID ? (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser. The site sets Google Analytics audience measurement cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_{GA4_ID.replace('G-', '')}</code>, 13 months at most), with no advertising{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. Details, legal basis and how to object: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>) : (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser and the site sets no cookies{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored anonymously with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>)}
    {/* /gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <p>On data protection: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a>. As of: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
